# Scratch files (temp scripts, downloaded tarballs, extracted package copies).
tmp-*
tmp*/

# `lib/` is deliberately NOT ignored: `dsh plugin add github:<owner>/dsh-jev-advisor`
# installs this repository as-is, and pnpm only runs a `prepare` script for a
# git dependency — one it blocks until the user allowlists it in the profile's
# pnpm-workspace.yaml. Shipping the built files keeps a git install a single
# command. `npm test` starts with `scripts/build.mjs --check`, which fails when
# `lib/` drifts from `src/`, so the committed copy cannot silently go stale.
